.TH "INSPEKT\-ASK" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-ask \- Ask a question about the current page using AI.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]ask\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]] \f[I]QUESTION\f[R]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Ask a question about the current page using AI.
.PP
Uses the cached page index (from `inspekt index') to answer questions.
The AI has access to:
.IP \(bu 2
Full semantic structure and text content
.IP \(bu 2
Interactive elements and their accessible names
.IP \(bu 2
Vision AI descriptions of images
.PP
Examples of questions you can ask:
.IP \(bu 2
\(lqWhat is this page about?\(rq
.IP \(bu 2
\(lqWhat\(cqs the price of this product?\(rq
.IP \(bu 2
\(lqSummarize the main article\(rq
.IP \(bu 2
\(lqWhat accessibility issues might exist?\(rq
.IP \(bu 2
\(lqWhat\(cqs in the main image?\(rq
.PP
Tip: Run `inspekt index' first to cache the page for faster queries.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\f[I]QUESTION\f[R]
required text argument
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\(enget\-url\f[R]
Output the inspekt:// URL instead of executing
.TP
\f[B]\(endebug\f[R]
Show the full prompt instead of calling AI
.TP
\f[B]\(enno\-cache\f[R]
Force re\-index instead of using cache
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
inspekt ask \(dqWhat is this page about?\(dq
inspekt ask \(dqWhat products are available?\(dq
inspekt ask \(dqSummarize the article\(dq
inspekt index
inspekt ask \(dqWhat\(aqs the nutriscore?\(dq
inspekt ask \(dqWhat\(aqs in the image?\(dq
inspekt ask \(dqSummarize\(dq \-\-no\-cache
.EE
